From 684b125408a85bd8ab3c20f9e3add84fb4457553 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nakya <nakya@Mac-mini-di-Nakya.local>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 21:40:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat: office-watch reports open questions with options

A question with options is a send-message/widget entry; the app doesn't set
awaitingUserResponse for it, so office-watch follows each conversation and
emits {type:'question', open} when one is waiting for an answer or gets one.
internals adds a transcript check.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
